sequenceDiagram
    participant User as User / DSP API
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.2+
    participant Controller as workflow-controller<br/>9090/TCP metrics<br/>6060/TCP health
    participant K8sPod as Kubernetes<br/>Pod Scheduler
    participant ArgoExec as argoexec<br/>(emissary in pod)
    participant S3 as S3-compatible Storage<br/>443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.2+
    participant DB as PostgreSQL/MySQL<br/>5432/3306 TCP

    Note over User,DB: Flow 1: Workflow Execution

    User->>K8sAPI: Create Workflow CR<br/>HTTPS/443 | SA Token
    K8sAPI-->>Controller: Informer watch event<br/>HTTPS/443 | SA Token
    Controller->>Controller: Reconcile workflow<br/>(32 concurrent workers)

    Controller->>K8sAPI: Create execution Pod<br/>HTTPS/443 | SA Token
    K8sAPI->>K8sPod: Schedule Pod

    K8sPod->>ArgoExec: Start emissary executor<br/>(init + main container)
    ArgoExec->>ArgoExec: Wrap user container lifecycle<br/>Capture stdout/stderr

    ArgoExec->>S3: Upload/Download artifacts<br/>HTTPS/443 | SecretKeySelector credentials
    S3-->>ArgoExec: Artifact data

    ArgoExec->>K8sAPI: Update WorkflowTaskResult CR<br/>HTTPS/443 | SA Token
    K8sAPI-->>Controller: TaskResult watch event

    Controller->>K8sAPI: Update Workflow status<br/>HTTPS/443 | SA Token

    Note over User,DB: Flow 2: Workflow Archiving (Optional)

    Controller->>K8sAPI: Watch completed Workflows<br/>HTTPS/443 | SA Token
    K8sAPI-->>Controller: Workflow completion event
    Controller->>DB: Archive workflow data<br/>TCP/5432 or 3306 | Username/Password<br/>SSL configurable

    Note over User,DB: Flow 3: CronWorkflow Scheduling

    Controller->>Controller: Cron scheduler tick<br/>(8 dedicated workers)
    Controller->>K8sAPI: Create new Workflow from CronWorkflow<br/>HTTPS/443 | SA Token
